    "description": "47-11 AKM Grips: FFFTech/FFFTechnology\n\nGrips for AK pattern / AKM rifles; with similar overall geometry of Browning 1911 pistol's grip. \n\nTwo variants are available, each with two subvariants: \n\n *Standard\n  *Integrated Panel, Standard\n\n *Micro Ridge\n  *Integrated Panel, Micro Ridge\n\nOEM and aftermarket full sized 1911 grip panels, as well as FFFTech 1911 grip panels are compatible; \nand are a drop in fit.\n\n\n(Integrated Panel subvariant grips DO NOT use grip screws, nor grip screw bushings.)\n\n\nPrinter Used: Ender 3 V2\n\nFilament Used: PLA+\n\nPrint Settings:\n\nExtruder: 220C \nBed: 55C \nFirst Layer Print Height: .20mm \nStandard Layer Height: .14mm\nWall Thickness: .40 \nWall Perimeters: 5+\nInfill: 25%+\nInfill Pattern: Gyroid\nMaterial Flow: 100%\nSupport Material Percentage: 18%\n\nPrint the grip upside down\n\nSupport Material ONLY needed for the grip screw bushing ports, and below the INTEGRATED grip panels. Use the support \nblocker setting in the preferred slicer program for everywhere else within the model.\n\n\nHardware Needed:\n\n1x OEM AK Grip Screw\n\n4x (OPTIONAL) 1911 Grip Screw Bushings\n\n4x (OPTIONAL) 1911 Grip Screws\n\n\n\nNotes: \n\n1) When installing grip screw bushings, use RED Loctite and let cure for at LEAST 24 hours before grip \npanel installation.",
